-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §28 תוספת עוז לתמורה למורים ביישום חלקי
-- של הרפורמה: a teacher to whom the reform is applied in part, in
-- תשע"ב–תשע"ד, is entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement of §16 at 15.75%,
-- 21% and 31.5% — three eighths, a half and three quarters of its 42%.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-4`
IMPORT `oz-founding-16`
IMPORT `oz-founding-26`

§ `28 תוספת עוז לתמורה למורים ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה`

-- ¶1–¶4: teachers to whom the reform is applied in part (as §26's opening
-- defines them, with "באותה שנת לימודים": the school applies it in part
-- that year), in תשע"ב–תשע"ד, are entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement
-- "כמפורט בסעיף 16", but at these rates: 15.75% in תשע"ב, 21% in תשע"ג,
-- 31.5% in תשע"ד. The referral brings §16 whole (convention
-- reading.referral): the supplement on the combined salary and the 2001 and
-- 2008 supplements, a separate component counting for what §16(ב) lists.
@ref akn:art_28/p1 akn:art_28/p2 akn:art_28/p3 akn:art_28/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement rate in part application in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y (15.75%) (21%) (31.5%)

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's own, at his position
      `the 2001 supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the 2008 supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement under section 28` y m e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement` IS
    IF `a teacher in the Oz part application in` y m e
    THEN fromMaybe 0 (`the Oz LaTmura supplement rate in part application in` y)
         TIMES (`the combined salary` PLUS `the 2001 supplement` PLUS `the 2008 supplement`)
    ELSE 0

GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement under section 28 counts for` p IF
    `the Oz LaTmura supplement counts for` p

-- §16(ג), which the referral brings too, raises the 1987 and 1994
-- supplements "בשיעור של 42%" of their value on the eve of the signing.
-- Whether ¶1's "שיעורי התוספת" put the year's rate in place of that 42%
-- as well as (א)'s is not said (F-oz-founding-28-a). The reading adopted
-- (convention reading.consistent): yes — in full application the two are
-- one rate, and §28 pays the supplement in part application at a part of
-- it; the increase follows the year's rate.
@ref akn:art_28/p1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `the supplement without the increase` IS A NUMBER @desc the 1987 or the 1994 supplement as it would be paid without §16(ג)
      `its value on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER @desc its shekel value on 13.8.2011
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1987 or 1994 supplement at section 28's rate in` y `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing` IS
    `the supplement without the increase`
    PLUS fromMaybe 0 (`the Oz LaTmura supplement rate in part application in` y) TIMES `its value on the eve of the signing`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the supplement without the increase` IS A NUMBER
      `its value on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 28` y m e `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing` IS
    IF `a teacher in the Oz part application in` y m e
    THEN `the 1987 or 1994 supplement at section 28's rate in` y `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing`
    ELSE `the supplement without the increase`

§§ `28 -- illustrations`

-- 15.75% of 10,500 in תשע"ב, 31.5% in תשע"ד; none in full application,
-- where §16 pays 42%
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement under section 28` `the school year 5772` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part` 10000 300 200 EQUALS 1653.75
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement under section 28` `the school year 5774` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part` 10000 300 200 EQUALS 3307.5
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement under section 28` `the school year 5772` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in full` 10000 300 200 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement under section 28` `the school year 5775` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part` 10000 300 200 EQUALS 0
-- the rates are three eighths, a half and three quarters of §16's
#ASSERT map `the Oz LaTmura supplement rate in part application in` (LIST `the school year 5772`, `the school year 5773`, `the school year 5774`) EQUALS map (GIVEN f YIELD JUST (f TIMES `the Oz LaTmura supplement rate`)) (LIST 3/8, 1/2, 3/4)
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement under section 28 counts for` `computing the hour value`
#ASSERT NOT `the Oz LaTmura supplement under section 28 counts for` `computing supplement 2011`

-- F-oz-founding-28-a's evidence: §16(ג)'s increase is printed at 42%, the
-- rate of (א), which ¶1 replaces; on the reading adopted a 1994 supplement
-- of 500 on the eve, 520 since, is paid in תשע"ב as 520 + 78.75, where
-- (ג)'s own 42% would make it 520 + 210.
`section 28 does not say whether its rates reach section 16(ג)'s increase` MEANS
        `the Oz LaTmura supplement rate` EQUALS 42%
    AND `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 28` `the school year 5772` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part` 520 500 EQUALS 598.75
    AND `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 16(ג)` `the Oz reform in full` 520 500 EQUALS 730
#ASSERT `section 28 does not say whether its rates reach section 16(ג)'s increase`
